  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance support to the World Bank/Government of Uganda through a programme funded post.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Technical assistance support to the World Bank/Government of Uganda through a programme funded post. is a component of Northern Uganda: Transforming the Economy through Climate Smart Agribusiness (NU-TEC) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 104 - Procurement of Services and a budget of &#xa3;220,257. It works in the following sector(s): Agricultural policy and administrative management, Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development.</narrative>
  </description>
